```
// Nothing is less than a PHDR:
if (y.p_type == PT_PHDR) return false;

// PHDR's are less than everything (that's not a PHDR)
if (x.p_type == PT_PHDR) return true;

// Sort non-PHDR's by address:
...
```

Comments are just suggestions.

